; `main` is what `menard emit` (src/emit/lower.mnd) looks for and lowers
; to a real (untag/trunc/`ret`) instruction sequence computing a process
; exit code — the interpreter also calls it automatically after the
; top-level forms above (host/src/interp/eval.ts), so both the
; interpreted and compiled runs of this file exit 0.
(defn main -> Int 0)
